WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:29.220
We will begin after sunset,

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:33.250
<b><i>Like a Rhinoceros</i></b>

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:31.310
but we'll head there now and wait.

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:33.250
That's fine, right?

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:35.750
Yeah, seems fine.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:39.430
Then, I'll get things ready at the tea shop.

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:41.920
I'll be back before nightfall.

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:43.570
Okay, I'll go, too.

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:47.140
There, it goes...

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.660
What, is it broken?

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:51.840
The fastener flew off.

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:53.900
It's gotten too small again.

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:57.150
Saizou, can you do this without Shikibu?

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:59.340
Yeah... I suppose.

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:02.030
It's just the knee piece, right?

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:04.180
Can't he do without it?

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:05.230
No.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:06.040
Come to the shed with me.

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:08.040
Should I help?

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:11.840
No, you should follow the plan.

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:14.290
Hibiki... Hachisu. Help me.

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:18.550
So you've gotten more muscular again.

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:20.000
Sorry.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.460
There's no reason to apologize.

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.800
That's just your body. You can't help it.

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:25.560
Yeah.

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:28.160
Take everything off.

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:32.500
I see.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.810
Could you two leave for a minute?

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:38.320
But you can stay, if you really 
want to see Shikibu naked.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:50.170
Looks like the whole thing needs adjusting.

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:52.080
There's a barn out back...

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:55.330
The old Saibougu is on one of the shelves.

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:57.430
It's tighter than what you have,

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:59.590
but if you don't move, it'll be fine.

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:02.340
Just wear it and stay put.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:03.250
Okay.

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.450
First...

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:07.880
Go take a bath.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.660
You kind of stink.

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:10.600
But...

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:13.350
Thirty minutes or so will do.

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:15.730
Your body won't explode.

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:31.110
What was that about?

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:35.070
His body exploding without this.

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:35.950
Oh...

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:42.480
This armor's purpose isn't merely 
to protect him from attacks.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.040
It's more important than that.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:45.630
It's a lifeline, you could say.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.640
A lifeline?

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:50.480
If he doesn't use this to compress his body,

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:52.940
his body will explode and kill him.

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:58.270
The muscle inside his body is too 
powerful for his skin, perhaps.

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:01.650
It seems he was born this way.

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:07.910
There's an old saying about wandering 
alone, like a rhinoceros.

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:09.540
A rhinoceros?

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:15.400
A rhinoceros is a huge, one-horned 
beast that lives in India.

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:19.290
They don't form packs, and never 
look any direction but forward.

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:21.870
And they only move straight ahead.

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:25.300
The Buddha compared them to monks 
trying to achieve enlightenment.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:26.810
And that's...

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:31.720
Yes, wander alone, like a rhinoceros.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.960
That's the origin of the name 
"Saibougu," or "Rhino Armor."

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:37.810
<b><i>Saibougu — Rhino Armor</i></b>

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:37.810
It's the armor to protect him, 
as he goes through life alone.

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:43.730
Someone's here.

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:45.570
We're surrounded.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:47.950
Seems so.

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:58.080
One in the shadow of the far-right tree.

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:00.710
One in the forest behind.

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:06.090
And one more. A big one!

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:15.520
If there are only three, leave it to Hachisu.

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:20.030
We need to repair the Saibougu, as quickly 
as possible, and give it to Shikibu.

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:20.850
Right.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.150
One more.

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:07.950
What is it?

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:09.850
The sounds are retreating.

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:13.300
Then Hachisu drove them off.

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.630
Let's hurry.

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:16.160
Yeah.

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:30.060
Where is he?

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:36.180
Nope.

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:56.950
You think you did well to get me 
away from that shed, right?

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.360
It's the other way around.

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:02.580
My target wasn't that girl named Hibiki.

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:06.240
But her follower. You.

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:20.960
What's wrong?

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.120
You aren't going to shoot?

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:41.830
Wait, Hibiki!

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:47.650
Shikibu?

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:16.530
Killing me isn't easy.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:20.300
The bullets from my Lotus Root 
Gun didn't hurt him...

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:22.040
Strikes probably won't, either.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:25.040
You're also a monster, aren't you?

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:46.690
What's wrong, monster?

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:50.870
You okay, Hachisu?!

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:52.440
Let's retreat... for now.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.480
Don't stop working.

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:15.090
We're trapped!

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:21.020
Hey!

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:32.990
It's crazy, Shikibu!

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:35.170
There's a gap, so let's just wait.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.350
I see.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:43.070
Your body...

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:45.300
You heard?

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:47.660
You should've said something.

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:50.690
I thought it would creep everyone out.

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:54.820
I didn't want you guys to leave me.

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:57.080
Fool.

00:11:57.630 --> 00:12:00.600
But... that's what had to happen.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:06.560
This is my punishment... for wanting 
to be with everyone.

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:09.450
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:12:13.110 --> 00:12:17.140
I've killed many people... So many...

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:21.220
So this is my punishment.

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:34.230
<i>Renouncing violence against all living beings, 
harming not a single one.</i>

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:42.820
What's wrong?

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:43.530
Hurry!

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.880
A wrap! Get him a new wrap!

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:50.590
It seems he was working with it loose again.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:56.060
<i>Renouncing violence against all living beings, 
harming not a single one,</i>

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:59.530
<i>you would not wish for offspring.</i>

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:02.870
<i>So how, then, for a companion?</i>

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:27.270
Wander alone, like a rhinoceros...

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:32.450
You can't kill living things. 
I understand that.

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.910
I'm careful not to step even on ants.

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:36.900
Good to hear!

00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:38.860
Priest...

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:41.980
But why can't I have friends?

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:47.220
Why do I have to live alone?

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:52.720
Wander alone, like a rhinoceros.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:58.020
Those were the Buddha's words to 
those who would follow his path.

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.440
Those who would live as his priests

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:04.800
must want neither children 
nor friends, and live alone.

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:09.050
I can't play with anyone?

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:12.240
You must not want to.

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:16.000
I can't be friends with anyone?

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.700
You must not wish for them.

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:22.300
Wander alone.

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:26.130
Wander alone, like a rhinoceros.

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:30.840
Endlessly repeat those words in your heart.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:00.500
Stupid...

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:04.210
"Wander alone"? What?

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:07.880
What's the point of letting 
those words rule your life?

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:13.890
You want to be with everyone, right?

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:16.640
You want to protect our leader, right?

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:21.520
If someone wants to kill our leader, 
you have to kill them, right?

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:25.190
So...

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:29.400
Whether you're punished or not, 
no sense in worrying about it.

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:32.660
It's our job.

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:39.410
I'm ashamed to say it, 
but I must leave it to you.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:42.920
Don't forget that I have my own magic.

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:45.760
I don't sense them anymore.

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:53.860
This is bad...

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:54.940
It's hitting me.

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:57.020
It sure hurts...

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:58.730
It hurts!

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:02.330
Where?

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:03.800
Where does it hurt most?

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:05.420
Here?

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:08.320
What?

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.340
It hurts, right?

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:14.570
My body's disgusting, isn't it?

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:20.130
I'm like a... monster, right?

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.340
Just tell me.

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:25.300
Where does it hurt most?

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:32.760
So you're Hibiki?

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:33.950
Don't worry.

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.220
I was told not to kill you.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:38.220
But...

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:12.500
I see...

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:14.570
So you're...

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:16.170
The Kouga...

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.320
Hachirou...

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:35.030
Hachirou!

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:38.850
We were apart for so long,

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:41.140
but it was like we were always together!

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:46.060
So I thought I didn't need 
to see you anymore...

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:47.470
But...

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:51.680
You came to fight the Joujinshuu, didn't you?

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:54.220
Let's fight together!

00:18:55.400 --> 00:19:00.120
Hachisu said that if we could 
control our power,

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:02.580
we might be able to do something incredible!

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:20.930
You know, I was told to be a great kunoichi,

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:24.830
to strengthen my skills 
for our leader's sake.

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:26.150
Ever since I was a kid.

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:29.640
But it didn't work at all.

00:19:30.110 --> 00:19:32.570
I couldn't use any techniques well.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:36.560
So this was all I could rely on.

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:41.520
But if I can do my job,

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:44.710
it's nobody's business how I do it, is it?

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:47.730
Because it's all I can do.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:53.280
So, I don't know how to say it, but...

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:59.630
There's no need to let another's 
words rule your life, is there?

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:31.130
Shikibu, are you okay?

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:34.960
I guess...

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.470
Hurry!

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:42.220
He thought...

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:46.720
he pierced my true heart, but...

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:50.830
My skin's thickness turned the blade aside.

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:13.250
I told you, killing me isn't easy.

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:15.290
It isn't easy...

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:19.440
It isn't easy to kill anyone!

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:22.260
But...

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:35.560
Do you think... I'm gonna 
get punished... again?

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:41.040
If you do, that's fine.

00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:43.860
We'll suffer it together.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.960
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:26.010 --> 00:23:27.970
A child journeys with its mother.

00:23:27.970 --> 00:23:31.970
But the journey has an end 
that no one wishes for.

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:36.190
I know that autumn can be a painful thing,

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:38.480
<b><i>The Wind Blows Through the Pines</i></b>

00:23:36.190 --> 00:23:39.300
but I shall never tire of the 
sound of the bell crickets.
